<title>GERMANY: Austrian airliner believed hijacked to Berlin.</title>
<headline>Austrian airliner believed hijacked to Berlin.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Berlin airport officials said an Austrian Airlines plane made an unscheduled landing at Berlin's Tegel airport on Tuesday and added that police believed it may have been hijacked.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for the Berlin Brandenburg Flughafen Holding (BBF) identified the plane as an Austrian Airlines aircraft.  </p>
<p>The spokeswoman said she could not confirm reports that the plane had just taken off from Berlin headed for Vienna when it turned back and landed.</p>
<p>The spokeswoman said she had no further details at the moment.</p>
</text>
